{"unit_id":"bainianlaoyao__bash-on-windows#card-zh","repo":"bainianlaoyao/bash-on-windows","commit":"5ebd72beeb22ca178ed6dd086a6d0f5272b16ecf","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"bash-on-windows 是面向 DSH Web 客户端的插件，为 Windows 会话提供仅使用 Git Bash 的终端配置。它通过 bundle patch 启用 bash 执行器、禁用 PowerShell，并提供 standard、code 和 cordis 三种 bash-only 会话预设；同时在全权限模式下调整模型可见的升级参数，并处理同模式升级回声。适合希望在 Windows 的 DSH 会话中使用 Git Bash 的用户。需要预先安装 Git for Windows 并将 bash 放入 PATH，再安装 bundle 并选择对应预设。","source":"generated","evidence":["cordis.patch.yml:12-54","plugins/escalation-inert.mjs:91-111","presets/standard-bash/preset.yml:1-3"]}
{"unit_id":"bainianlaoyao__bash-on-windows#card-en","repo":"bainianlaoyao/bash-on-windows","commit":"5ebd72beeb22ca178ed6dd086a6d0f5272b16ecf","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"bash-on-windows configures DSH Web sessions to use Git Bash as the only Windows terminal. Its bundle patch enables bash, disables PowerShell, and provides standard, code, and cordis bash-only presets. Install Git for Windows with bash on PATH, add the bundle, and choose a preset.","source":"generated","evidence":["cordis.patch.yml:12-54","plugins/escalation-inert.mjs:91-111","presets/standard-bash/preset.yml:1-3"]}
